{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上流傳一段車Cam片段，事發於今日（17 日）早上 7 時 21 分。一名電單車司機沿高速公路快線行駛，當行至某路段時，前方車輛因路面阻塞而減慢車速，惟電單車司機懷疑收掣不及，撞向前方一輛白色私家車車尾。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-17-11h58m45s060.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026pfFc5jzXem1789618300.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-17-11h58m45s060.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">強烈撞擊下，電單車司機整個人被撞飛摔出，倒臥在路邊。幸運的是，涉事電單車司機身體並無大礙，不久後便能自行站起，並主動向白色私家車司機示意自己情況還好，化險為夷。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-17-11h58m52s254.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026do4UPWb0vz1789618294.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-17-11h58m52s254.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">影片隨即引起大批網民熱烈討論，不少網民藉此警示駕駛電單車的危險性，提醒駕駛者必須打起十二分精神，留言表示：「皮包骨，真係要小心」、「26分咗心？正常係停得切，好彩人冇事。」，亦有網民直言「要睇清前面路況。」，提醒所有司機注意跟車距離與前方交通動態。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T04:19:18.352191+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":309,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}